---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Lifelong Learning Challenge Game" description="Download the artwork for the Lifelong Learning Challenge Game card deck">
  <h1>Lifelong Learning Challenge Game Card Deck</h1>
  <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem; justify-content: center; align-items: center; margin: 1rem auto;">
    <img src="/assets/LLC_GAME_TITLECARD.png" alt="Lifelong Learning Challenge Game Title Card" style="height: 300px; width: auto; max-width: 100%;">
    <img src="/assets/LLC_GAME_OVERVIEW.png" alt="Lifelong Learning Challenge Game Overview Card" style="height: 300px; width: auto; max-width: 100%;">
  </div>
  <p>This file contains the artwork for the Lifelong Learning Challenge Game card deck that can be printed as physical cards at vendors such as <a href="https://carddeckprinting.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">carddeckprinting.com</a>.</p>
  <p><a href="/docs/LLC_GAME_(v3).pdf" download class="download-link">Download PDF</a></p>
</BaseLayout>